      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 12
    },
    {
      "displayText": "移动速度是对战的关键！<U+0010><U+0001>븁\n可以一口气拉进距离，\n也可以避开敌方的招式！<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕǧ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 8,
      "offsetInSection": 432,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "79FB52A8901F5EA6662F5BF9621876845173952EFF0100100001BE01000A53EF4EE54E0053E36C1462C98FDB8DDD79BBFF0C000A4E5F53EF4EE5907F5F00654C65B9768462DB5F0FFF0100100002011401E70000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 42
    },
    {
      "displayText": "而且我和摩托蜥它们\n每天都在密阿雷奔跑……<U+0010><U+0001>븀\n还学会了提升移动速度的招式！<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕǧ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 9,
      "offsetInSection": 516,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "800C4E146211548C6469625887255B834EEC000A6BCF592990FD57285BC6963F96F759548DD12026202600100001BE00000A8FD85B664F1A4E8663D0534779FB52A8901F5EA6768462DB5F0FFF0100100002011401E70000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 44
    },
    {
      "displayText": "换句话说！我们是最快的！\n也是最强的！<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕǧ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 10,
      "offsetInSection": 604,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "636253E58BDD8BF4FF0162114EEC662F67005FEB7684FF01000A4E5F662F67005F3A7684FF0100100002011401E70000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 24
    },
    {
      "displayText": "驾嗷！",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 11,
      "offsetInSection": 652,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "9A7E55F7FF010000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 4
    },
    {
      "displayText": "驾安！！",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 12,
      "offsetInSection": 660,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "9A7E5B89FF01FF010000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "驾哦！！！",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 13,
      "offsetInSection": 672,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "9A7E54E6FF01FF01FF010000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 6
    },
    {
      "displayText": "来吧！如果你心存怀疑，\n就和我们对战吧！<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕǧ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 14,
